milestones.guidance:
The whole game lives or dies here. One dict per room, keyed by name, with a description and exits:
```python
rooms = {
    "hall": {
        "desc": "A dusty hall. Doors lead north.",
        "exits": {"north": "library"},
    },
}
```
Design 5+ rooms on paper first (draw boxes and arrows), THEN transcribe them into dicts. Include an ending room (e.g. "vault" with the treasure) and at least one dead end.

